          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does ConvergeFlow replace our dental PMS?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A PMS replacement is not a confirmed capability. Use the ConvergeFlow demo to establish the product’s role beside your existing systems. Ask which records are available, how information moves between systems and what your staff must review. A PMS name displayed in an interface does not establish a working integration."
